    "summary": "Barcelona, Spain, November 4th: FXStreet has surpassed 1 million views on its YouTube channel in less than two months, representing year-over-year growth of more than 1,500%, compared to the 61,000 views recorded during the same period last year. This milestone highlights the success of its video content strategy and reinforces the company’s efforts to diversify\nThe post FXStreet Surpasses One million YouTube Views in Less Than Two Months appeared first on BeInCrypto.",
